<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">20 December in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">5 events that happened on 20 December, from 1606 to 2001.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1606">1606 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">420 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Virginia Company ships sail for America</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">The Susan Constant, Godspeed and Discovery left <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/london">London</a> with about 105 colonists. In May 1607 they founded <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jamestown">Jamestown</a>, the first permanent English settlement in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/north-america">North America</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/north-america">North America</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jamestown">Jamestown</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/virginia">Virginia</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1803">1803 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">223 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The United States takes possession of Louisiana</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">In a ceremony in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-orleans">New Orleans</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a> formally handed the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/louisiana">Louisiana</a> Territory to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a>. The purchase roughly doubled the country's size and gave it control of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mississippi-river">Mississippi</a>.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/louisiana">Louisiana</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1860">1860 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">166 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">South Carolina secedes from the Union</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">A convention in Charleston voted unanimously to leave the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a> after Lincoln's election. Six more states followed before his inauguration, forming the Confederacy.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/1989">1989 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">37 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">The United States invades Panama</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">US forces launched <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states-invasion-of-panama">Operation Just Cause</a> to remove Panama's military ruler <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manuel-noriega">Manuel Noriega</a>, who was wanted in the US on drug trafficking charges. Noriega surrendered on 3 January 1990.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb tih-event-hero"><p class="tih-hero-kicker">&#10022; Anniversary of the day</p><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/argentina" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/argentina.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/years/2001">2001 CE</a> <span class="tih-ago">25 years ago</span></p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Argentina's president resigns amid riots</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">President <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/fernando-de-la-rua">Fernando de la Rúa</a> resigned and fled the Casa Rosada by helicopter as protests over economic collapse left dozens dead. Days later <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/argentina">Argentina</a> declared the largest sovereign default to that date.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/argentina">Argentina</a></div></div></li></ol>
